{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b121ccee-4ed8-8c49-bcfa-cd4d6bc58f0b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T10:39:37-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:58-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:03-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, hello. I would like to get a marriage license, please. I want to know what I must bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:11-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, congratulations. Are both of you able to come in together? That's the main thing, you both need to appear in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:19-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, both of us. Um... como se diz... the two of us together, yes. We can come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:26-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Each of you brings a valid photo ID, like a driver's license or a passport. You'll also need your full legal names, dates of birth, and where you were born. And your parents' names, including mothers' maiden names."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:40-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The parents' names, the mother before she was married. I write this down. Slowly, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:46-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Photo ID, date and place of birth, parents' names with the mother's maiden name. If either of you was married before, you'll need to know when and how that marriage ended."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:58-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no. Neither of us was married before. Only the first time for both. Do I need the birth certificate also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:38:06-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually not for a first marriage if your ID is good, but a copy doesn't hurt if you have one. If you were born outside the country, bring whatever you have and we can sort it out at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:38:20-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was born in the Azores. Portugal. I have my passport and my green card. That is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:38:27-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, those work fine. Bring both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:38:30-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the fee, please. How much is the fee for the license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:38:35-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a fee, and it's due when you apply. I don't want to quote you a number off the top of my head and have it be wrong, so check with the counter when you come in. Just bring a way to pay. Cash or card, either one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:38:52-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, cash or card. And what are the hours? I have to call quickly, because I pick up my kids in a few minutes, from school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:01-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open weekdays during regular business hours, so you could come this week. Mornings tend to be quieter than afternoons."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:08-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings. Good. Maybe Thursday. I will ask my fiancé if he can take the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:14-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Just make sure he brings his ID too. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:20-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that is all. Photo ID, birth place, parents' names, and the fee. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:26-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:29-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. You are very kind. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:39:34-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Congratulations again. Bye now."
    }
  ],
